[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16268.79, "timestamp": "04:31:08", "text": "吉野嗎？  各位，要嘛是吉野，要嘛她已經"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16294.309, "timestamp": "04:31:34", "text": "我有一種預感。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16301.269, "timestamp": "04:31:41", "text": "不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16303.349, "timestamp": "04:31:43", "text": "等等。堅持，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16315.269, "timestamp": "04:31:55", "text": "稍等。也許這是渡渡鳥的表演。也許是吧。不，不，不。不，也許這是渡渡鳥的表演。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16319.67, "timestamp": "04:31:59", "text": "或許是因為我們有渡渡鳥吧，你還記得嗎？"}]